<omdoc base="latin:/logic/pl-views.omdoc"><metadata><link rel="http://cds.omdoc.org/mmt?metadata?sourceRef" resource="latin:/logic/pl-views.mmt#0.0.0:2523.124.0"/><meta property="http://cds.omdoc.org/?metadata?importedby"><om:OMOBJ xmlns:om="http://www.openmath.org/OpenMath"><om:OMLIT type="http://www.openmath.org/cd?OpenMath?OMSTR" value="mmt-omdoc"/></om:OMOBJ></meta></metadata><instruction text="namespace latin:/"/><opaque format="text"><metadata><link rel="http://cds.omdoc.org/mmt?metadata?sourceRef" resource="latin:/logic/pl-views.mmt#20.2.0:85.2.65"/></metadata>Interdefinability of logics is formalized in various views.</opaque><instruction text="import rules scala://lf.mmt.kwarc.info"/><instruction text="fixmeta http://cds.omdoc.org/urtheories?LF"/><opaque format="text"><metadata><link rel="http://cds.omdoc.org/mmt?metadata?sourceRef" resource="latin:/logic/pl-views.mmt#145.7.0:360.9.51"/></metadata>The views currently still need single theories as a domain and codomain, which 
  forces us to provide spurious named theories. This should be refactored when
  multi-theory domains and codomains are possible.</opaque><mref name="[latin:/?NegationTruth]" target="latin:/?NegationTruth"><metadata><link rel="http://cds.omdoc.org/mmt?metadata?sourceRef" resource="latin:/logic/pl-views.mmt#365.11.0:384.11.19"/></metadata></mref><mref name="[latin:/?NegationFalsity]" target="latin:/?NegationFalsity"><metadata><link rel="http://cds.omdoc.org/mmt?metadata?sourceRef" resource="latin:/logic/pl-views.mmt#430.16.0:451.16.21"/></metadata></mref><mref name="[latin:/?NegationTruthND]" target="latin:/?NegationTruthND"><metadata><link rel="http://cds.omdoc.org/mmt?metadata?sourceRef" resource="latin:/logic/pl-views.mmt#499.21.0:520.21.21"/></metadata></mref><mref name="[latin:/?NegationFalsityND]" target="latin:/?NegationFalsityND"><metadata><link rel="http://cds.omdoc.org/mmt?metadata?sourceRef" resource="latin:/logic/pl-views.mmt#597.27.0:620.27.23"/></metadata></mref><mref name="[latin:/?FalsityNegTruth]" target="latin:/?FalsityNegTruth"><metadata><link rel="http://cds.omdoc.org/mmt?metadata?sourceRef" resource="latin:/logic/pl-views.mmt#700.33.0:719.33.19"/></metadata></mref><mref name="[latin:/?FalsityNegTruthND]" target="latin:/?FalsityNegTruthND"><metadata><link rel="http://cds.omdoc.org/mmt?metadata?sourceRef" resource="latin:/logic/pl-views.mmt#799.38.0:820.38.21"/></metadata></mref><mref name="[latin:/?TruthNegFalsity]" target="latin:/?TruthNegFalsity"><metadata><link rel="http://cds.omdoc.org/mmt?metadata?sourceRef" resource="latin:/logic/pl-views.mmt#936.44.0:955.44.19"/></metadata></mref><mref name="[latin:/?TruthNegFalsityND]" target="latin:/?TruthNegFalsityND"><metadata><link rel="http://cds.omdoc.org/mmt?metadata?sourceRef" resource="latin:/logic/pl-views.mmt#1035.49.0:1056.49.21"/></metadata></mref><mref name="[latin:/?NegationConjunction]" target="latin:/?NegationConjunction"><metadata><link rel="http://cds.omdoc.org/mmt?metadata?sourceRef" resource="latin:/logic/pl-views.mmt#1198.56.0:1223.56.25"/></metadata></mref><mre